# User yt-dlp configuration. Every supported yt-dlp option is available here.
# The system config selects the managed Deno runtime for bundled yt-dlp-ejs.
# The downloader's "Download using saved configuration" action uses this file
# without imposing a format, output directory, or output filename.
#
# Optional examples (uncomment and adjust the settings you want):
# --write-subs
# --write-auto-subs
# --sub-langs "en.*,sv.*"
# --embed-metadata
# --embed-thumbnail
# --embed-subs
# --sponsorblock-mark all
# --download-archive "~/Downloads/yt-dlp-archive.txt"
# --cookies-from-browser firefox
# --plugin-dirs "~/my-yt-dlp-plugins"
# --use-postprocessor PLUGIN_NAME
